{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202490","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202490","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1120249001:1":{"text":"... You brought this many men to see us off? Are you still trying to pick a fight?","source_cn":"……你带着这么多人送我们？不会是还想打架吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1D66B1DE5E23860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120249002:1":{"text":"Pay them no mind. I just wanted to see you guys off properly.","source_cn":"不用在意他们，我是真心实意想送你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC784E8101F669651","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120249003:1":{"text":"Just to be clear... The Grimmaw Clan never wanted trouble with you.","source_cn":"诸位，无论如何……一切都是我，黑嚎氏族并没有要跟你们为难……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA59C18EC6CD9AA51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120249004:1":{"text":"You don't sound very convincing...","source_cn":"……你这话，可真没说服力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B12677F34443A4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120249005:1":{"text":"... Well, starting now at least, nobody will cause you trouble.","source_cn":"……最起码，从现在开始，不会再有人为难你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49FD574F74BD117","variant_status":"","male":"","f